Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.42,0:00:07.85,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去寻找吧 收集起梦的碎片{\fad(250,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.46,0:00:18.70,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使胸中苦闷 去感受真切的现在吧{\fad(0,400)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.67,0:00:23.70,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比外表更单纯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.41,0:00:27.07,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是却无法传达
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.98,0:00:34.68,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要说的话 总是藏在口袋里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.29,0:00:41.02,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,充满孩子气的话语 如今已无法开口
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.73,0:00:49.19,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽说时间会冲淡一切 我们却无法相互理解
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.30,0:00:55.30,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,24小时 一直相信着你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.51,0:00:59.20,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.24,0:01:03.77,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使只是俗常的话语
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.25,0:01:10.05,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时间总是 微笑着匆匆流逝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.32,0:01:21.79,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比起回忆 还是去追求理想的今天{\fad(0,1025)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.87,0:01:41.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这题考前猜到了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.94,0:01:44.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这题也是轻轻松松解决
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.64,0:01:47.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯嗯 最近很用功
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.95,0:01:49.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.18,0:01:51.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,了不起 日暮同学
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.68,0:01:53.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,满分呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.62,0:01:55.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.19,0:01:57.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样高中入学考试也没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.35,0:01:58.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恭喜你 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.09,0:02:00.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恭喜
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.03,0:02:02.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.53,0:02:05.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢大家
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.43,0:02:08.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是梦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.70,0:02:11.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是梦吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.21,0:02:20.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然是梦…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.22,0:02:33.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第57话 一切源自桃源乡之夜 前篇
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.93,0:02:40.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.16,0:02:41.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你又要回国啦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.07,0:02:44.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这事用不着这么大声吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.44,0:02:47.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你啊 知道现在是什么时候吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.40,0:02:48.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.07,0:02:49.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道归知道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.01,0:02:51.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我有很重要的模试呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.34,0:02:54.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,摸是？那什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.75,0:02:57.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,模拟试验 就是考试的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.78,0:03:00.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又是什么“烤事”啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.42,0:03:03.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托 只要三天
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.25,0:03:05.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还想预习一下
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.26,0:03:08.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总觉得戈薇姑娘也蛮辛苦的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.19,0:03:11.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直留在这里就轻松多啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.76,0:03:13.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三天吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.73,0:03:16.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就那么喜欢那个 叫“烤事”的东西啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.77,0:03:18.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么可能会喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.70,0:03:21.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然有点抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.97,0:03:24.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也想回去故乡个三天
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.08,0:03:26.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,故乡？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.78,0:03:28.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要回驱魔师的村子吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.88,0:03:32.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想修理飞来骨
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.79,0:03:44.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为使用过度了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.73,0:03:45.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么办法
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.93,0:03:47.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有三天喔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.23,0:03:49.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了 那我也可以吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.07,0:03:51.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.44,0:03:54.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三天后我会到枫姥姥的村子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.74,0:03:56.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧 云母
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.31,0:04:03.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看样子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.45,0:04:05.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总算难得能好好休息了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.25,0:04:07.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.32,0:04:10.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚在就不能好好休息吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.59,0:04:12.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 不是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.82,0:04:16.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉会答应的这么干脆
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.53,0:04:18.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在看什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.40,0:04:20.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.33,0:04:22.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就快点回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.54,0:04:26.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.19,0:04:45.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是跑到这里的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.63,0:04:53.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要去哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.06,0:04:55.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,饶了我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.70,0:04:58.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难得收你当弟子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.94,0:05:01.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你居然逃避修行
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.07,0:05:05.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你讨厌风吹日晒 与饿的前胸贴后背
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.21,0:05:06.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更不想最后被逼着上战场
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.08,0:05:10.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像蝼蚁一般死去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.41,0:05:13.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说这些话的不是你吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.59,0:05:15.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,饶…饶了我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.95,0:05:18.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经对世间没有留恋了…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.66,0:05:19.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是你这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.59,0:05:24.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才让你进入桃源乡 修炼成为仙人的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.60,0:05:26.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经不想当仙人了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.90,0:05:29.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么可怕的地方我受够了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.17,0:05:37.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愚蠢的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.87,0:06:08.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事 好浓的雾
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.07,0:06:10.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.01,0:06:12.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.21,0:06:18.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总觉得这果实好恶心
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.78,0:06:20.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是…人面果
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.88,0:06:22.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人面果？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.29,0:06:23.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.72,0:06:26.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是以人类作为养分
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.16,0:06:28.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结出很像人脸的果实的妖树
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.96,0:06:31.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖树…就是妖怪树吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.03,0:06:32.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.16,0:06:36.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是会有这么多漂过来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.67,0:06:39.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,表示是相当大的树呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.04,0:06:41.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这种时代
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.67,0:06:43.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来场大型战争
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.17,0:06:45.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肥料就多的用不完了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.54,0:06:46.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.68,0:06:49.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种深山里会有战争吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.68,0:06:51.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.18,0:06:55.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 去调查看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.92,0:06:57.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是要回去吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.92,0:07:00.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正一定会在意的念不下书
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.82,0:07:02.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且考试是三天后
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.26,0:07:06.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没闲功夫休息啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.33,0:07:07.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等 这些家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.70,0:07:09.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要无视我自己走掉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.83,0:07:11.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别拖拖拉拉的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.44,0:07:12.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可是赶时间呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.00,0:07:15.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点解决掉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.27,0:07:17.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真受不了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.46,0:07:32.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看样子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.59,0:07:35.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人面果树就在这上面
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.46,0:07:37.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这峭壁的上面吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.53,0:07:43.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是那个吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.60,0:07:44.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.10,0:07:47.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么巨大的人面果树
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.30,0:07:48.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还是头一次看到
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.21,0:07:52.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且这股不祥的妖气…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.31,0:07:53.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.54,0:07:56.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该是用了很多人当养分吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.95,0:07:58.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.32,0:07:59.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.65,0:08:01.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.32,0:08:02.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还用说吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.82,0:08:04.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一口气砍断那棵妖树
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.59,0:08:06.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么我们也帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.22,0:08:07.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.96,0:08:10.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等到把你们一个个送到峭壁上
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.33,0:08:12.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太阳都下山了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.60,0:08:13.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么这样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.96,0:08:15.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉一定打算
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.97,0:08:17.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在太阳下山前解决掉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.57,0:08:20.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今晚是朔日
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.34,0:08:22.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朔日…新月！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.47,0:08:25.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉的妖力会消失
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.34,0:08:26.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,变成普通人类的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.18,0:08:28.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以犬夜叉才…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.99,0:08:40.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还没有长生不老的果实啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.36,0:08:48.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老是这种东西连我都吃腻了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.87,0:08:54.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是你…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.21,0:08:57.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,养着这棵妖树吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.01,0:09:00.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.64,0:09:01.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.78,0:09:03.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然没有感受到妖气
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.51,0:09:05.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,却散发出浓厚的死人臭味
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.52,0:09:11.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呸 找我有什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.92,0:09:14.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,懒得跟你废话
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.59,0:09:17.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要砍掉这棵怪异的树
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.23,0:09:18.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是你胆敢阻碍
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.03,0:09:22.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阻碍你又怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.13,0:09:24.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就连你一起砍
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.77,0:09:32.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对付这肥嘟嘟的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.54,0:09:34.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎牙起不了作用
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.24,0:09:35.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.55,0:09:39.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就用风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.93,0:09:50.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤竟然…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.76,0:09:52.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖怪吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.56,0:09:53.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是愚蠢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.96,0:09:55.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然不知道是打哪来的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.13,0:09:58.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你以为赢得了仙人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.97,0:10:00.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仙人？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.67,0:10:04.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 我是桃源乡的仙人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.18,0:10:06.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桃果人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.28,0:10:10.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,葫芦变大了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.08,0:10:16.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才不是 是你变小了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.29,0:10:19.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎牙竟然…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.59,0:10:23.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 这不是幻觉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.16,0:10:24.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.96,0:10:26.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙真的是仙人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.00,0:10:29.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,同样的事别让我说太多遍
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.70,0:10:32.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然是仙人 为什么要这样做
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.20,0:10:35.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧 想要进来这里面吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.81,0:10:37.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.98,0:10:46.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这只妖怪一定是上好的肥料
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.52,0:10:51.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加油啊 七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.32,0:10:52.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只差一点点了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.32,0:10:54.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 真让人刮目相看
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.63,0:10:56.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想不到你的力气这么大
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.00,0:10:59.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是太大意了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.73,0:11:01.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没想到今天是朔日
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.83,0:11:04.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太阳下山以后
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.40,0:11:06.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉就会变成普通人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.77,0:11:08.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.27,0:11:11.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.64,0:11:15.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.35,0:11:16.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抓好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.39,0:11:23.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.42,0:11:29.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看样子好像有人住在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.16,0:11:31.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.36,0:11:35.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.77,0:11:41.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人类？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.87,0:11:43.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有其他人耶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.88,0:11:46.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这到底是什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.28,0:11:47.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.44,0:11:49.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们住在这个地方吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.28,0:11:51.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么搞的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.92,0:11:54.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂碎片变大了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.45,0:11:57.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,箱庭也变大了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.29,0:12:01.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 是我们正在缩小
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.07,0:12:18.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里是？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.12,0:12:28.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是刚才在走路的小小男人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.12,0:12:29.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,意思是…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.82,0:12:32.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里是箱庭的内部吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.42,0:12:36.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么办啦 我们也得住在这里了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.36,0:12:39.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不想个办法出去不行
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.33,0:12:40.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉会担心的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.00,0:12:42.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且四魂碎片也…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.00,0:12:44.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说的也是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.50,0:12:46.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是要怎么做
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.30,0:12:48.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在还搞不清楚状况
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.87,0:12:49.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.11,0:12:52.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先听听看这里的人怎么说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.74,0:12:56.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请问 大家在这里做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.81,0:12:58.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里并非真实的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.85,0:13:00.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.02,0:13:03.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 有没有在听啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.45,0:13:05.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别打扰我们
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.96,0:13:07.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们妨碍到修炼了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.82,0:13:08.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,修炼？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.96,0:13:12.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在这做成为仙人的修炼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.16,0:13:15.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成为仙人的修炼？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.87,0:13:17.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要拥有仙人之力
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.27,0:13:19.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就能离开这里
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.77,0:13:20.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还能从桃果人大人那里
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.77,0:13:23.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得到长生不老的人面果
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.04,0:13:25.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桃果人？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.48,0:13:28.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是把你们 困在这的罪魁祸首吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.55,0:13:29.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桃果人大人是将我们
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.05,0:13:34.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从饥饿与战乱之中 救出来的大恩人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.92,0:13:36.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要胡说八道
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.49,0:13:46.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么看都只是生锈的刀
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.80,0:13:51.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为何那小子一挥 就变成了大刀呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.67,0:13:53.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了 管他的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.32,0:14:06.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.38,0:14:08.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎牙已经掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.19,0:14:12.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我却没有妖化成妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.42,0:14:15.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来妖力已经减弱成这样了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.03,0:14:17.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,话说回来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.33,0:14:19.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然被困在这种鬼地方
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.20,0:14:21.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,火鼠衣被…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.90,0:14:24.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看样子不能再拖下去
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.70,0:14:26.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只好从内部破坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.20,0:14:29.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,散魂铁爪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.48,0:14:33.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.21,0:14:35.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有一点点伤痕
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.11,0:14:36.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,浑蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.22,0:14:40.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.12,0:14:40.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要有铁碎牙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.08,0:14:42.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种东西才不放在眼里
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.96,0:14:49.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个死胖子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.06,0:14:52.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等我出去就把你大卸八块
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.23,0:14:54.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,浑蛋！浑蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.97,0:15:02.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爪子…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.74,0:15:05.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟了 妖力消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.09,0:15:18.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.66,0:15:25.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是四魂之玉碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.40,0:15:27.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且还有两块
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.40,0:15:28.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这玩意儿只要有一块
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.10,0:15:32.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就能让我的身体把刀子弹回去
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.27,0:15:36.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要有了这些
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.47,0:15:39.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是金刚不坏之身了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.91,0:15:46.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 愈来愈多了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.12,0:15:49.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再拖下去会被溶化的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.32,0:15:51.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.16,0:16:03.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做那些事就能成为仙人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.00,0:16:04.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不晓得
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.14,0:16:07.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要拥有仙术
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.20,0:16:09.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,的确需要肉体的锻炼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.81,0:16:10.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是精神方面
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.81,0:16:12.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也必须更加强韧才行
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.14,0:16:15.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请问 那边的诸位
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.58,0:16:18.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看起来你们不是这里的人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.15,0:16:20.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是武士吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.78,0:16:24.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你似乎和其他人不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.69,0:16:27.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 其实没差多少
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.26,0:16:28.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我因为战败
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.76,0:16:30.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在逃到这个山谷的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.96,0:16:32.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被桃果人抓来这里的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.03,0:16:36.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不想成为仙人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.50,0:16:37.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.47,0:16:41.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要我们会一点仙术的话
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.27,0:16:44.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上就会变成人面果的养分
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.31,0:16:47.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我亲眼看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.71,0:16:50.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桃果人与人面果在对话的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.22,0:16:55.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人面果 还没好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.49,0:16:58.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还没结出长生不老的果实吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.72,0:16:59.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还早着呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.22,0:17:03.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再拿更多的仙人之魂来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.46,0:17:04.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我说嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.20,0:17:07.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仙人这东西 哪可能有那么多
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.00,0:17:08.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.93,0:17:12.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你只要照我的话做就对了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.74,0:17:14.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.70,0:17:16.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是 人面果
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.51,0:17:18.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你很罗唆耶
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.27,0:17:18.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.04,0:17:20.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要把这个拿下来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.64,0:17:22.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就说不了话吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.78,0:17:23.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住 住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.08,0:17:27.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,由我代你保管
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.02,0:17:29.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用担心
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.32,0:17:32.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会把仙人之魂拿给你的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.09,0:17:34.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是谁！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.79,0:17:36.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么啊 战败的武士吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.33,0:17:46.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,进去吧！给我好好修行！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.81,0:17:55.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那很可能是四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.11,0:17:57.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然很微弱
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.68,0:18:00.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过还是能感受到 四魂碎片的气息
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.82,0:18:03.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是那家伙根本就是坏仙人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.06,0:18:07.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本来 所谓的仙人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.06,0:18:09.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听说如果没有舍弃世俗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.63,0:18:11.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,进入独特的境界的话
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.36,0:18:13.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是无法成为仙人的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.63,0:18:15.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以这里的这些人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.57,0:18:17.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是无法成为仙人的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.64,0:18:20.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是可怜
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.37,0:18:22.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟然是为了成为人面果的肥料
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.34,0:18:24.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而被强迫修行
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.61,0:18:28.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些家伙完全 把我说的事情当耳边风
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.41,0:18:31.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也一起去告诉他们
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.88,0:18:35.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了 就算知道这些事也逃不出去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.85,0:18:36.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有用的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.59,0:18:37.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么这样
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.89,0:18:40.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定有什么方法的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.09,0:18:42.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定能逃得出去的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.66,0:18:45.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉…你一定要平安无事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.03,0:18:48.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.87,0:18:50.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.17,0:18:52.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.94,0:18:54.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.37,0:18:56.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,变的会感觉到痛了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.07,0:18:59.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看样子已经变成普通人的身体
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.68,0:19:03.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要怎么样才能离开这里
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.15,0:19:07.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刀鞘在呼唤铁碎牙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.19,0:19:12.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎牙一定在这附近
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.36,0:19:14.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 这样也许有用
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.19,0:19:20.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧 铁碎牙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.70,0:19:28.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差不多该回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.92,0:19:42.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么搞的 这把烂刀
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.46,0:19:48.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错没错 就是这样子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.96,0:19:50.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.43,0:19:55.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,趁现在
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.94,0:20:02.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.74,0:20:05.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死胖子 觉悟吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.41,0:20:09.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是刚才那个妖怪小鬼吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.95,0:20:11.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,废话！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.68,0:20:14.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是还你的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.88,0:20:16.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好痛喔
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.69,0:20:21.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉碎片？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.76,0:20:25.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭小子 找死！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.70,0:20:27.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死胖子 你是从哪里…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.70,0:20:28.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该不会？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.93,0:20:33.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小鬼 该觉悟的是你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.77,0:20:39.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.51,0:21:13.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉碎片的威力
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.24,0:21:16.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然够厉害！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.05,0:21:22.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要怎么做
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.55,0:21:24.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要怎么做才能逃离这里
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.82,0:21:26.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这时候犬夜叉一定…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.09,0:21:28.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 没办法
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.56,0:21:30.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到处都找不到出口
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.53,0:21:31.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不论走到哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.79,0:21:33.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都只有墙壁而已
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.26,0:21:34.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.57,0:21:40.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有用的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.27,0:21:41.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要不就成为仙人之后
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.30,0:21:43.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,变成人面果的养分
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.34,0:21:46.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要不就这样在这里等死
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.31,0:21:48.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有这两种下场
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.58,0:21:50.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么这样
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.28,0:21:51.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这里…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.28,0:21:54.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有任何梦想或希望
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.82,0:22:01.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果是梦就醒来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.93,0:22:06.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种恶梦我不想再做了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.79,0:22:30.36,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,何不把真正重要的事物以外{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.96,0:22:41.86,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全部 都舍弃呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.14,0:22:49.38,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现实 往往是如此残酷
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.55,0:22:53.11,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但每当 遇到这种时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.32,0:22:57.85,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只要紧闭双眼
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.12,0:23:04.59,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,便能看见 你的笑容{\fad(0,900)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.60,0:23:12.06,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Ah- 但愿从此以往
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.11,0:23:19.64,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到进入 沉眠的那一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.58,0:23:27.14,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的 那抹笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.92,0:23:35.16,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都绝没有 消逝的瞬间{\fad(0,900)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.17,0:23:50.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是梦 一定是梦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.14,0:23:52.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 捏我一下看看…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.34,0:23:54.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好痛…果然不是梦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.21,0:23:57.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 你现在因为朔日
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.35,0:23:58.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而变成了普通人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.95,0:24:00.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么可能打赢
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.88,0:24:02.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个施展怪异仙术的桃果人
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.65,0:24:05.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要为了我舍命？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.99,0:24:08.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋 不行啊 犬夜叉！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.43,0:24:10.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.73,0:24:13.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切源自桃源乡之夜 后篇
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.30,0:24:15.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黎明…快点来临吧
